  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "path_t",
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 900140,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 900141,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "x": 1918,
   "y": 188,
   "width": 604,
   "height": 162.5,
   "text": "StepPath is the real hierarchy\n\nThe nesting is not a parent id in the events: it is\nencoded in StepPath, for example\n\n  MyLoop/Iter_2/Inner\n\nOnly step.started/completed/validation/timeout, branch.*\nand pipeline.suspended carry it; llm, tool, tag and routing\nevents do not. To build a tree in a UI, split the path.",
   "originalText": "StepPath is the real hierarchy\n\nThe nesting is not a parent id in the events: it is\nencoded in StepPath, for example\n\n  MyLoop/Iter_2/Inner\n\nOnly step.started/completed/validation/timeout, branch.*\nand pipeline.suspended carry it; llm, tool, tag and routing\nevents do not. To build a tree in a UI, split the path.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
